== Trivia ==
* A cod worm is an aquatic parasite of marine fish.
* Cod worm has a resemblance to the Pokémon [[bulbapedia:Shuckle|Shuckle]].
* Prior to [[Booster Packs#Booster Pack #5|Booster Pack #5]], if a Cod Worm was killed before enemies finished spawning, the Cod Worm would die, even in its invincible form.

